OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry start
OL,6,Fto the evening with some pleasant
OL,7,Fevening sunshine. A band of cloud and
OL,8,Fheavy showers pushes in from the
OL,9,Fsouthwest through the early hours
OL,10,Fbringing a risk of thundery downpours,
OL,11,Fmainly to the south by dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FCloudy start to Wednesday
OL,14,Fwith heavy or thundery showers. Cloud
OL,15,Flifts into the afternoon, bringing
OL,16,Fsome brighter or sunny spells,
OL,17,Falthough scattered heavy or thundery
OL,18,Fshowers still possible. Feeling warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
